  data: {
    LLM: "Listen to every question. If Player A asks Player B for the 5 of Spades, you now know that Player A has at least one Low Spade (2-7) and Player B does NOT have the 5 of Spades. Memorize this information.\n\nThe False Scent: If you have four cards of a half-suit, and you know an opponent is tracking you, ask for a card in a DIFFERENT half-suit where you only have one card. This confuses their tracking of your 'power' suits. Negative Inference: If Player A asks Player B for a card and B doesn't have it, and later Player C asks Player D for the same card and D doesn't have it, you know the card must be with one of the remaining opponents.\n\nDeclarer's Coordination: Don't declare too early. If you know your partner has the 9 of Hearts but you aren't sure about the 10, ask for the 10. Even if you miss, your partner now knows YOU have Hearts and can follow up. The 'Loaded Question': If you have 5 of the 6 cards in a half-suit, ask for the 6th card from an opponent who you suspect has it. If they give it to you, claim immediately. If not, you've learned who doesn't have it, narrowing down the location.",
    Player: "Listen to every question. If Player A asks Player B for the 5 of Spades, you now know that Player A has at least one Low Spade (2-7) and Player B does NOT have the 5 of Spades. Memorize this information.\n\nThe False Scent: If you have four cards of a half-suit, and you know an opponent is tracking you, ask for a card in a DIFFERENT half-suit where you only have one card. This confuses their tracking of your 'power' suits. Negative Inference: If Player A asks Player B for a card and B doesn't have it, and later Player C asks Player D for the same card and D doesn't have it, you know the card must be with one of the remaining opponents.\n\nDeclarer's Coordination: Don't declare too early. If you know your partner has the 9 of Hearts but you aren't sure about the 10, ask for the 10. Even if you miss, your partner now knows YOU have Hearts and can follow up. The 'Loaded Question': If you have 5 of the 6 cards in a half-suit, ask for the 6th card from an opponent who you suspect has it. If they give it to you, claim immediately. If not, you've learned who doesn't have it, narrowing down the location.",
    aggressiveness: 0.5,
